MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 47e38c55d300bbc4eab1bff25e62fcce, type: 3}
  m_Name: IntroCutscene
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WanderersGuild.CutsceneData
  slides:
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    placeholderColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    text: In a fantastical world filled with monsters and various dangers, exist adventurers to fight against those who seek to disrupt humanity's peace.
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    placeholderColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    text: 'Those that decide to take that path must register at a guild in order to be rewarded for their efforts....





      Including you.'
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    placeholderColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    text: 'Now retired, you start wandering the world, trying to help when you can.

      In your travels, you reach a faraway region, filled with monsters, dungeons, and people in need.'
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    placeholderColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    text: There are few adventurers in the area, especially capable ones, so you decide to take matters into your own hand.
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    placeholderColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    text: 'Though you are old, there are other ways you can contribute to the fight.

      You decide to open your very own guild, so you can help the younger adventurers better survive and prosper.'
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    placeholderColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    text: With your humble shack now converted into a make-shift guildhall, you can start your journey.
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    placeholderColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    text: 'Welcome adventurers!

      ...

      ...

      ...

      ...

      ...

      To the Wanderer''s Guild!'
